    "body": "\n\n## Overview\n\nClamp the client-supplied `kv_transfer_params.remote_prefill_cached_tokens` override to `[0, prompt_len]` before it becomes `num_cached_tokens`. Fixes #58728.\n\nThis is the clamp @ptimizeroracle proposed in #58730, which robertgshaw2-redhat acked on the issue. That PR was closed by its author on 2026-10-23 for lack of review. I reproduced the bug independently on current main and am resubmitting the same approach with an end-to-end reproduction. Credit for the fix goes to @ptimizeroracle.\n\n## Claims\n\n- A client can no longer set `usage.prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens` to an arbitrary or negative value through `kv_transfer_params`.\n- `vllm:request_prefill_kv_computed_tokens` no longer goes negative for such requests.\n\n## Validation\n\nReproducer on CPU through the real request path: JSON body, `CompletionRequest.to_sampling_params`, `OutputProcessor`, `IterationStats`. The prompt has 17 tokens and no local cache hits.\n\n| Client sends | cached_tokens before | kv_computed before | cached_tokens after | kv_computed after |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 9999 | 9999 | -9982 | 17 | 0 |\n| -5 | -5 | 17 | 0 | 17 |\n| 3 | 3 | 14 | 3 | 14 |\n\nNew test, on the base commit and with the fix:\n\n```\n$ pytest -q tests/v1/engine/test_output_processor.py -k remote_prefill   # base\nFAILED tests/v1/engine/test_output_processor.py::test_remote_prefill_cached_tokens_clamped_to_prompt_len[9999-8]\nFAILED tests/v1/engine/test_output_processor.py::test_remote_prefill_cached_tokens_clamped_to_prompt_len[-5-0]\n2 failed, 4 passed, 58 deselected\n$ pytest -q tests/v1/engine/test_output_processor.py -k remote_prefill   # this PR\n6 passed, 58 deselected\n```\n\n`ruff check`, `ruff format --check` (0.14.0, the pre-commit pin) and `tools/pre_commit/mypy.py 3.11 vllm/v1/engine/output_processor.py` pass. The test runs in the `engine.yaml` step (`pytest -v -s v1/engine`).\n\nI could not run a `RemoteOpenAIServer` test here, because this machine's driver cannot run current main's CUDA 13 kernels. The reproducer above covers the same path below the engine core.\n\n## Details\n\n`kv_transfer_params` is an ordinary request field on the completions, chat, responses and messages endpoints, and `to_sampling_params` forwards it with or without a KV connector. `OutputProcessor` copied `remote_prefill_cached_tokens` into `num_cached_tokens` with no bounds check. The clamp matches the bounds of the local count in `PrefillStats`. The Rust frontend change in #58885 reads the same field and may want the same bound.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n\n- [x] **Design Fit:** Minimizes impact on core components, reuses existing functionality, and justifies added complexity.\n- [x] **Testing and Validation:** Validates the change and ensures any added tests are meaningful and reliable, with CI coverage or documented CI resource constraints and validation performed outside CI.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** Keeps code and comments clear and concise, and updates relevant documentation and examples.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes a brief summary and relevant links, supports claims with evidence, explains root causes and implementation trade-offs, and follows the contributing guide.\n</details>\n\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63659?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795583291&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63659&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63659&signature=8d787090346553ec58139237994b69bf810faf065c1a6878bc68ad3bbed4b535\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63659?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795583319&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63659&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63659&signature=e0b9fe119197662e9c1399dddf117f8ae858afa19db0e0821ed2918fc332675d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
